    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/769746d5675d2cabd865973768fb4607.avif?t=1752376383\" width=720 height=478 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/cd135591fd1574246315e90889c989af.avif?t=1752376383\" width=502 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goddess of Mischief, Loki, finds a cursed swamp that isn't of her doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding to make this curse her own, she ventures out to explore and conquer the marshland and its inhabbitants for her own machinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/f8b084e82020b51bfa8bf573a5bae439.avif?t=1752376383\" width=720 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering the cursed lands, she finds her powers seriously weakened, and the creatures of the swamp to be uncooperative and even hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Loki beat sense into the goblin tribes and transform the malediction into a power of her own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/a5831d575620a71128ed73b80d3843db.avif?t=1752376383\" width=502 height=108 /></span><br>- A very VERY difficult, unusual RPG Maker meets turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex combat system that punishes skill spam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies that can telegraph their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loki needs to use smart tactical counter-attacks based on the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No grinding (you can avoid unnecessary fights)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/769746d5675d2cabd865973768fb4607.avif?t=1752376383\" width=720 height=478 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/cd135591fd1574246315e90889c989af.avif?t=1752376383\" width=502 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Goddess of Mischief, Loki, finds a cursed swamp that isn't of her doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deciding to make this curse her own, she ventures out to explore and conquer the marshland and its inhabbitants for her own machinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/f8b084e82020b51bfa8bf573a5bae439.avif?t=1752376383\" width=720 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon entering the cursed lands, she finds her powers seriously weakened, and the creatures of the swamp to be uncooperative and even hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Loki beat sense into the goblin tribes and transform the malediction into a power of her own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468280/extras/a5831d575620a71128ed73b80d3843db.avif?t=1752376383\" width=502 height=108 /></span><br>- A very VERY difficult, unusual RPG Maker meets turn-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex combat system that punishes skill spam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enemies that can telegraph their attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loki needs to use smart tactical counter-attacks based on the situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No grinding (you can avoid unnecessary fights)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
